                    <msContents>
                        <summary>
                            <p>Book of medical receipts, etc. A physician's handbook of practical medicine, with notes on medical astrology, blood-letting, uroscopy, etc. Some additions by several 16th cent. hands.</p>
                            <p>Ff. 1-4 Latin-German glossary of medical terms, from 'Elephantiasis' to 'Ulcus'.</p>
                            <p>5-13 Vocabularius herbarum. Latin-German.</p>
                            <p>16-23 Notes on the Ages of Man, Complexions, Temperaments, etc.</p>
                            <p>24-29 Salves and unguents.</p>
                            <p>32-40 Simplicia.</p>
                            <p>41v-43 Index.</p>
                            <p>44v-46 Eclipses, medical astrology. The table of eclipses is for the years 1547-1551.</p>
                            <p>47-56 Blood-letting.</p>
                            <p>60-100 Uroscopy.</p>
                            <p>102-120v Von der verdeulichen artznein aller seucte. Dated at the end 1524.</p>
                            <p>121-360 Flos doctorum. Diseases and their remedies in alphabetical order. The last entry is 'Tumor et inflatio'.</p>
                            </summary>
                        <textLang mainLang="de" source="IANA">German</textLang>
